[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.86]left a single note and went on their way
[00:10.00]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.64]now it plays here every single day
[00:19.72]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:24.40]One note at a time
[00:29.24]from people passing through
[00:34.26]a name beside a line
[00:39.28]and part of it is you
[00:46.20]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
